From aa2d31e9864a784fe761c35c7932030feba387d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:21:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: repair gear - durability in inventory, interact.repair,
 runner repairs after deaths (F-219)

Mid-run, the rogue, goblin warrior and hunter wore durability 0 on nearly every item (deaths +
spirit rez wear gear; bots never repaired). Broken weapons fail weapon abilities - Sinister Strike
232x EQUIPPED_ITEM_CLASS_MAINHAND with a dagger at 0/20 - and broken armour has none: the late-run
death spiral of every melee bot.
- inventory: durability / max_durability (ITEM_FIELD_DURABILITY = OBJECT_END + 0x36)
- interact.repair: CMSG_REPAIR_ITEM (npc, item 0 = all, guild bank 0)
- runner: World.repairers (npcflag 0x1000); maybe_repair after every revive (<30 %, up to 600 yd)
  and on level-up (<70 %, a vendor within 150 yd)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
